    "name": "Sijilmassa Forum of Malhun Art",
    "id": "sijilmassa-malhun-forum",
    "description": "Forum in Errachidia celebrating malhun, the Moroccan sung-poetry art that weaves classical and colloquial Arabic into qasidas of praise, love, nature and satire, honoring its living masters and supporting active troupes.",
